@title Data Reliability Team Charter
@subtitle Osprey Freight, effective 2026-11-01

# Mission

Make every dataset the business relies on trustworthy, on time and explained.

# What we own

- The freshness and quality checks on the 40 tier-1 tables.
- The data incident process.
- The lineage catalog.

# What we do not own

- Dashboards and their business logic. Analytics owns these.
- Source application databases. Product teams own these.
- Ad-hoc data requests.

# How we work

We run two-week sprints. A data on-call rotates through the team and responds to tier-1 incidents within 30 minutes during business hours. Every incident gets a written review within 5 business days.

# How to reach us

Post in the #data-reliability channel, or open a ticket in the DREL queue.

! Requests sent by direct message will be redirected to the queue.
